      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "THE CONSTRUCTOR PROBLEM\nCar(\"V8\", 4, 5, \"Red\", true, false)\n\nWhich boolean means sunroof? Which means navigation? Optional values need placeholders, and more constructor combinations get difficult to maintain.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 16,
      "containerId": null,
